sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant D as Delegates
  U->>O: multi-opinion request
  O->>O: Fix known issues and run checks
  O->>D: Start delegates in parallel
  D-->>O: Findings and score out of 10
  O->>O: Verify findings against code
  O->>D: Fresh review after fixes
  D-->>O: Round scores
  O->>U: Summary and council table
